@startuml

autoactivate on

title 수집 시스템

actor 관리자 as admin

box "수집 시스템 삭제"
participant Client as client
participant CollectorController as collectorController
participant CollectorService as collectorService
end box

box "Catalog API 작업수행 서버"
participant FastApi as fastApi
end box

client -> collectorController : 수집대상 삭제 요청
collectorController -> collectorService : 수집대상 삭제
collectorService -> fastApi : Airflow Dag 삭제 요청
fastApi -> collectorService : Airflow Dag 생성 삭제 결과 반환
collectorService -> collectorController : 수집대상 삭제 결과 반환
collectorController -> client : 수집대상 삭제 결과 반환

@enduml